note sha2h.om: sha256_hash (the one sha256.om entry point client.om calls) over om/tls sha2.om, for
note programs that compose the TLS stack. sha256.om and tls/sha2.om both define sha256_init, _update
note and _final, so a TLS program composes tls/sha2.om ... tls/tls.om and this unit instead of sha256.om.
note Library unit: no om2 line, no main, no globals.

fn sha256_hash d view uchar * o out uchar 32 to void
n = sha2_digest 256 d o
end
